# Vitrine Project Base

Project files are the source of truth.

Before meaningful changes, read:
- `AGENTS.md`
- `docs/ai-context/CURRENT_STATE.md`
- `docs/ai-context/DO_NOT_BREAK.md`
- `docs/ai-context/OPEN_THREADS.md`

For architecture, data, or design-system work, also read:
- `docs/ai-context/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- `docs/ai-context/DECISION_LOG.md`
- `docs/ai-context/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`

Do not rewrite architecture unless explicitly asked. Do not introduce libraries without checking existing patterns and Expo Go compatibility.

After meaningful work, update `CURRENT_STATE.md`, `IMPLEMENTATION_LOG.md`, `OPEN_THREADS.md`, and `HANDOFF.md`. Update `DECISION_LOG.md` only when a durable decision changes.
